Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I need nothing from you. Goodbye.
Go to node ID=
Icon=Exit Icon
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=10 What are you
Text=I am your servant, bound to you by bone and death. I have forsaken all life so that I might perform your will.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=And what is the reason for your existence?
Go to node ID=100 duty

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Look at you - a shambling wreck of bones, barely held together by my magic. How do you think one such as you could be of any use to me?
Go to node ID=70 look bad

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=And what of my achievements? My deeds? Are these not worthy of praise?
Go to node ID=110 evil deeds

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I find the reaffirmation of your devotion gratifying. As you were.
Go to node ID=

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Very well. Goodbye.
Go to node ID=
Icon=Exit Icon
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=20 Feeling Good
Text=I am certain that the poison of goodness and elation shall pass, master. Such things are transitory compared to the cold chill of death and misery that consumes all things.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Indeed. As you were.
Go to node ID=
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=30 Feeling Bad
Text=Excellent, master. It is only when one is surrounded by oppression and harm can one truly be strong. Your inner darkness is a beacon to all of us that dwell in the realms of undeath. As you say...badness is good.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Indeed. As you were.
Go to node ID=
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=70 look bad
Text=Death has not been kind, master, and I hope this broken shell you see before you in some small way inspires you to reduce all living things to my wretched state. Does this please you?
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I am pleased. I even feel...good.
Go to node ID=20 Feeling Good

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Your pathetic words have done nothing to ease the oppression on my mind.
Go to node ID=30 Feeling Bad

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Return to your duty and ask me no more questions. Goodbye.
Go to node ID=
Icon=Exit Icon
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=100 duty
Text=I guard your magical realm of death, master. All of your servants of death await the day of the Final Crusade, where you will lead us against the living world.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=And tell me again, creature - who do you serve?
Go to node ID=10 What are you

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Look at you - a shambling wreck of bones, barely held together by my magic. How do you think one such as you could be of any use to me?
Go to node ID=70 look bad

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=And what of the achievements and deeds I have already performed? Are these not worthy of praise?
Go to node ID=110 evil deeds

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I find the reaffirmation of our destiny inspiring. As you were.
Go to node ID=

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Do not forget it. Goodbye.
Go to node ID=
Icon=Exit Icon
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=110 evil deeds
Text=Master, your deeds have already been burned on the face of the world for you are wizard of terrible power and fury. One does not cross you unless they wish to be bled of life and raised to serve you. Your name is synonymous with the dark places of the world, and you will soon be feared by kings and peasants alike.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text="Will be feared"?
Go to node ID=115 Will be?

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I find the reaffirmation of your devotion gratifying. As you were.
Go to node ID=

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Very well. That will be enough for now.
Go to node ID=
Icon=Exit Icon
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=115 Will be?
Text=No, Master, you *are* feared. If these kings and peasants were to hear of your evil, their spirits would flee their bodies rather than be struck dead by your hand.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text="*If* they were to hear of me"? Am I not evil? Is my evil not known?!
Go to node ID=120 sucking up

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I find the reaffirmation of your devotion gratifying. As you were.
Go to node ID=

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Very well. That will be enough for now.
Go to node ID=
Icon=Exit Icon
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=120 sucking up
Text=Few evil-doers can match the evil that you do, master. Your heart is fouler than the darkest pits of the world, so foul that even shadows fear to linger in your heart. You are a blight upon all of history, and evil is but a word compared to what you represent, master.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=And what *do* I represent?
Go to node ID=130 more sucking up

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I find the reaffirmation of your devotion gratifying. As you were.
Go to node ID=

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Very well. That will be enough for now.
Go to node ID=
Icon=Exit Icon
------------------------------------------------------------
