Text=Evil historians will gather to debate your evilness and conclude that you are the epitome of villainy. It makes me feel terrible to serve you, which is good, that is to say, bad, master.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I find the reaffirmation of your devotion gratifying. As you were.
